  "title": "Equity HAR-RV-X VIX component decomposition (Paper 4 mechanism diagnostic)",
  "description": "Decompose K1138 VIX predictive power into realized-vol component (\u03c3_21d), VRP (VIX\u00b2-\u03c3\u00b2_21d), term premium (VIX3M-VIX), SKEW, VVIX. Test each individually (M1..M6) and jointly (M7 encompassing) vs HAR-RV baseline (M0) on Parkinson RV target for SPY/QQQ/IWM. Diagnose whether VIX is realized-vol proxy (Scenario A) vs genuine IV signal (Scenario B/C/D).",
